# Melo Creative

> Brand authority agency. Melo closes the credibility gap for businesses, building the brand that makes the market see what they already deliver: branding, visual identity, high-end websites and film production, delivered end-to-end in-house.

Melo Creative is a creative agency based in São Paulo, Brazil, operating since 2020. It has delivered 3,000+ projects, accelerated 50+ brands, and works 100% in-house from strategy to final render. Its client roster is concentrated in health, tech and law businesses — companies whose credibility comes from technical or professional authority and that need a brand that matches it — but the agency isn't limited to those industries.

## Services

- Strategy: positioning and market direction for the brand.
- Brand: visual and verbal identity systems.
- Websites & Systems: high-end websites, platforms and proprietary tools.
- Film production: full audiovisual production, from script to final frame.

